WEBVTT

00:00:01.029 --> 00:00:02.678
WELCOME, HARRY,
TO DIAGON ALLEY.

00:00:17.215 --> 00:00:18.694
[OWL SCREECHES]

00:00:20.131 --> 00:00:22.785
Hagrid: HERE'S WHERE YOU GET
YOUR QUILLS AND YOUR INK.

00:00:22.829 --> 00:00:24.700
AND OVER THERE,
ALL YOUR BITS AND BOBS

00:00:24.744 --> 00:00:26.398
FOR DOING YOUR WIZARDRY.

00:00:42.109 --> 00:00:44.111
[SCREECH]

00:00:52.075 --> 00:00:53.686
IT'S A WORLD-CLASS
RACING BROOM.

00:00:53.729 --> 00:00:58.081
WOW, LOOK AT IT!
THE NEW NIMBUS 2000.

00:00:58.125 --> 00:01:00.823
Boy: IT'S
THE FASTEST MODEL YET.

00:01:05.088 --> 00:01:08.004
BUT, HAGRID, HOW AM I
TO PAY FOR ALL THIS?

00:01:08.048 --> 00:01:09.963
I HAVEN'T ANY MONEY.

00:01:10.006 --> 00:01:11.443
WELL, THERE'S
YOUR MONEY, HARRY.

00:01:11.486 --> 00:01:13.532
GRINGOTTS--THE WIZARD BANK.

00:01:13.575 --> 00:01:16.012
T'AIN'T NO SAFER PLACE.
NOT ONE.

00:01:16.056 --> 00:01:18.189
EXCEPT PERHAPS HOGWARTS.

00:01:30.592 --> 00:01:33.204
UH, HAGRID...

00:01:33.247 --> 00:01:35.597
WHAT EXACTLY ARE
THESE THINGS?

00:01:35.641 --> 00:01:37.599
THEY'RE GOBLINS, HARRY.

00:01:37.643 --> 00:01:39.122
CLEVER AS THEY COME,
GOBLINS,

00:01:39.166 --> 00:01:41.473
BUT NOT THE MOST
FRIENDLY OF BEASTS.

00:01:41.516 --> 00:01:43.475
BEST STAY CLOSE.

00:01:43.518 --> 00:01:46.913
[CLEARS THROAT]

00:01:46.956 --> 00:01:50.525
MR. HARRY POTTER WISHES
TO MAKE A WITHDRAWAL.

00:01:52.092 --> 00:01:54.312
OHH.

00:01:54.355 --> 00:01:58.707
AND DOES MR. HARRY POTTER
HAVE HIS KEY?

00:01:58.751 --> 00:02:01.754
OH, WAIT A MINUTE.
GOT IT HERE SOMEWHERE.

00:02:05.410 --> 00:02:08.543
HA! THERE'S
THE LITTLE DEVIL.

00:02:08.587 --> 00:02:12.373
OH, AND THERE'S
SOMETHING ELSE AS WELL.

00:02:12.417 --> 00:02:15.202
PROFESSOR DUMBLEDORE
GAVE ME THIS.

00:02:20.120 --> 00:02:21.904
IT'S ABOUT YOU-KNOW-WHAT

00:02:21.948 --> 00:02:25.343
IN VAULT YOU-KNOW-WHICH.

00:02:26.344 --> 00:02:27.606
VERY WELL.

00:02:32.611 --> 00:02:35.266
VAULT 687.

00:02:38.181 --> 00:02:40.053
LAMP, PLEASE.

00:02:49.018 --> 00:02:50.672
KEY, PLEASE.

00:02:55.982 --> 00:02:59.333
[CLICK]

00:02:59.377 --> 00:03:03.337
[RATTLING]

00:03:03.381 --> 00:03:05.426
[CREAKING]

00:03:13.956 --> 00:03:15.218
DIDN'T THINK
YOUR MUM AND DAD

00:03:15.262 --> 00:03:18.918
WOULD LEAVE YOU WITH
NOTHIN', NOW DID YOU?

00:03:18.961 --> 00:03:21.268
Griphook: VAULT 713.

00:03:21.312 --> 00:03:22.530
Harry: WHAT'S
IN THERE, HAGRID?

00:03:22.574 --> 00:03:25.925
CAN'T TELL YOU, HARRY.
HOGWARTS BUSINESS.

00:03:25.968 --> 00:03:27.274
VERY SECRET.

00:03:27.318 --> 00:03:29.015
STAND BACK.

00:03:32.584 --> 00:03:36.544
[CLICKING]

00:03:36.588 --> 00:03:38.590
[STEAM HISSES]

00:03:56.912 --> 00:04:00.133
BEST NOT TO MENTION THIS
TO ANYONE, HARRY.

00:04:08.228 --> 00:04:12.014
I STILL NEED...A WAND.

00:04:12.058 --> 00:04:13.538
A WAND?
